From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] uiautomationcore: Dynamic Annotation provider (3584)

uiautomationcore: Dynamic Annotation provider

A node whose Main provider is an MSAA proxy gets an "Annotation" provider (queried before Main) when the
proxy's IAccessible supports IAccIdentity. It answers from the IAccPropServices table (oleacc): Name and
HelpText from the MSAA name/help annotations, ControlType from an annotated MSAA role, and any property
annotated under its own UI Automation property GUID. The window's own IAccessible (root check and the
default ProviderType_Proxy provider) is probed the way Dynamic Annotation does, IAccIdentity first and
then the parent; 21 todo_wine marks in the conformance test no longer fail.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS
